Description: Make the open-file smoke test portable to Launchpad builders
 Launchpad builds outside the build user's home directory. Keep the full
 command-line safety test when the fixture is under an allowed root, while
 always testing URI decoding in isolated build paths.
Author: Tomas Pluharik <tpluharik@gmail.com>
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-08-25
